## Legend

- **[MI](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#maintainability-index-mi)** — Maintainability Index (Visual Studio scale, 0–100): composite of Halstead volume, cyclomatic complexity, and SLOC; higher is more maintainable.
- **[SLOC](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#lines-of-code)** — Source Lines Of Code: total physical lines, including blanks and comments.
- **[Tokens](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#tokens)** — Total lexical tokens (AST leaves excluding comments) of the function or file.
- **[CC](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#cyclomatic-complexity-cc)** — Cyclomatic Complexity: number of linearly independent control-flow paths through the function.
- **[Cognitive](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#cognitive-complexity)** — Cognitive Complexity: how hard the code is for a human to follow; nesting and breaks in linear flow add weight.
- **[Effort](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#halstead)** — Halstead effort: estimated mental effort to (re)create the code.
- **[Volume](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#halstead)** — Halstead volume: program length weighted by vocabulary size.
- **[Est. Bugs](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#halstead)** — Halstead bugs: estimated defect count derived from program volume.
- **[Args](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#nargs)** — Number of declared parameters of the function.
- **[WMC](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#wmc)** — Weighted Methods per Class: sum of cyclomatic complexity across a type's methods. "Type" covers all six kinds counted here: class, struct, trait, impl, interface, namespace.
- **[Methods](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#nom)** — Number of methods declared on the class.
- **[NPA](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#npa)** — Number of Public Attributes declared on the class.
- **[NPM](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#npm)** — Number of Public Methods declared on the class.
- **[Exits](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#nexits)** — Number of exit points (returns, throws, breaks out of the function).
- **[ABC](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#abc)** — ABC magnitude: sqrt(A² + B² + C²) over Assignments, Branches, and Conditions.
- **[PLOC](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#lines-of-code)** — Physical Lines Of Code: source lines excluding blank lines and comments.
- **[Comments](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#lines-of-code)** — Comment lines (CLOC): lines that are entirely comment.
- **[Comment ratio](https://dekobon.github.io/big-code-analysis/metrics.html#lines-of-code)** — Comment ratio: comment lines as a percentage of source lines (CLOC / SLOC).
